### ==========================================
### 认证模块 — Authentication
### 路径前缀：/auth
### ==========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:9000

### ------------------- 登录（获取 Token）-------------------
### @name Login
# 使用用户名密码登录，返回 accessToken（Bearer token）
# 后续请求需在 Authorization 头中携带此 token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "vben",
  "password": "123456",
  "captchaKey": "",
  "captcha": "",
  "roleId": null
}

### ------------------- 注册 -------------------
### @name Register
# 注册新用户，注册成功自动返回登录凭证
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newuser",
  "password": "pass123",
  "email": "newuser@example.com"
}

### ------------------- 验证码登录 -------------------
### @name Code Login
# 使用手机号+验证码登录，用户不存在则自动创建
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/code-login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800138000",
  "code": "123456"
}

### ------------------- 忘记密码 -------------------
### @name Forget Password
# 通过邮箱验证码重置密码
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/forget-password HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "newPassword": "newPass123",
  "code": "verifyCode"
}

### ------------------- 退出登录 -------------------
### @name Logout
# 使当前 token 失效
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 刷新 Token -------------------
### @name Refresh Token
# 用旧 token 换取新 token（旧 token 作废）
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accessToken": "{{authToken}}"
}

### ------------------- 获取权限码列表 -------------------
### @name Get Auth Codes
# 返回当前用户所有按钮级权限码（用于前端按钮级权限控制）
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/codes HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 切换角色 -------------------
### @name Switch Current Role
# 切换当前用户在当前空间下的角色
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/current-role HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roleId": 2
}

### ------------------- 切换租户 -------------------
### @name Switch Tenant
# 切换到指定租户，同时自动进入该租户下的第一个工作空间
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/switch-tenant HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": 1
}

### ------------------- 切换工作空间 -------------------
### @name Switch Workspace
# 在当前租户内切换到指定工作空间，角色随之切换
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/switch-workspace HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workspaceId": 1
}

### ------------------- 获取用户工作空间列表 -------------------
### @name Get User Workspaces
# 返回当前用户在当前租户下的所有工作空间及角色
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/workspaces HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 获取用户租户列表 -------------------
### @name Get User Tenants
# 返回当前用户所属的所有租户
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/tenants HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
